id = "acc_necklace_pearl_sigil"
display_name = "Pearl Sigil of the Deep Sentinel"
description = "A pearl the trench dreamed around a bone core, strung on braided kelp by whatever hands the Sentinel keeps. The squeeze line reads the dream and labors to obey it: the deep forgives ten more meters, and no current can carry a body wearing the trench's own word."
